<speak>Good, that's the style I prefer. When a call moves too quickly, I write half a sentence and then try to catch up, so neither listening nor writing works very well. I'm looking at my page now and it's much neater than usual. I've kept the household reminders on a separate sheet as you suggested. Once this call ends, I can deal with those later instead of letting them spread across the dining table. The cat has returned, by the way, but he's settled on the chair this time.</speak>